  "notes": "Warm paper-like palette (cream #f5f3ec / #fffdf8) with navy primary and muted amber/red for gap and must-fix states; serif headings evoke an academic transcript. The app audits the user's own self-reported record: duplicate detection inserts an amber warning row inside the table with Remove-the-10:52-PM-entry / Keep-both actions; stat tiles tint amber when a gap applies; the right panel lists issue cards (MUST FIX / GAP pills) and green-check passes, then disabled Complete / Complete-with-gaps option cards and a Keep-as-draft fallback. Hours chart shows a hatched expected range and a short-by callout; Time-you-may-not-have-logged suggests adding hours inferred from watched lectures. Logged time cells show a device icon (desktop vs phone). Header has a segmented per-course progress strip. Main and aside scroll independently."
